{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-haiku-4-5-20251001","id":"msg_011CfPuiG9jJgaDHKW6DZMfe","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Perfect! All 13 tests pass. Let me verify the implementation is complete by reviewing a summary of the changes:\n\n## Summary of Implementation\n\nI've successfully implemented all three changes to `sample-service`:\n\n### 1. **Partial Fulfillment** ✓\n- Added `quantity` field to `Order` and `Shipment` (positive integer, default 1)\n- Added `DELIVERED` status to `ShipmentStatus` enum\n- Created `FulfilmentStatus` and `FulfilmentStatusType` to track order fulfillment\n- Implemented shipment allocation validation (rejects with HTTP 409 when allocation exceeds order quantity)\n- Added three shipment transitions: confirm, deliver, cancel\n- Implemented fulfillment status calculation: UNALLOCATED → PARTIALLY_ALLOCATED → FULLY_ALLOCATED → DELIVERED\n- Added GET `/orders?fulfilment=STATUS` filter with validation\n- Added PUT `/orders/{orderId}/quantity` endpoint to amend order quantity with validation\n- Canceling a shipment properly releases its quantity and updates fulfillment status\n\n### 2. **Customer Validation** ✓\n- Added customer existence validation when creating orders (throws HTTP 422 via `UnprocessableEntityException`)\n- Updated `GET /customers/{customerId}` to return HTTP 404 with error envelope for unknown customers\n- Updated `OrderControllerTest` to create customers before creating orders\n\n### 3. **Paged Lists** ✓\n- All list endpoints (`/customers`, `/orders`, `/shipments`) support pagination\n- `limit` parameter: 1-100, default 100 (validated with HTTP 400)\n- `offset` parameter: 0+, default 0 (validated with HTTP 400)\n- All responses include `X-Total-Count` header with total count before pagination\n- Lists sorted in ID order\n\n### Additional Changes\n- Added `CUSTOMER_NOT_FOUND` error code\n- Added `UnprocessableEntityException` class for HTTP 422 responses\n- Updated repositories to support pagination via `findAll(limit, offset)` methods\n- Added `update()` methods to repositories\n- No new Maven dependencies added\n\n**Build Status:** ✅ BUILD SUCCESS (13 tests passed)"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":8,"cache_creation_input_tokens":903,"cache_read_input_tokens":76618,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":903},"output_tokens":3,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"57a99e63-a5d9-44ef-930b-5a8cc28cba15","uuid":"d1f92545-90b9-453f-afe1-b3cc2f2142e1","timestamp":"2026-09-25T09:19:53.867Z","request_id":"req_011CfPuiFcykuPL4ewUTGKW8"}
